  "details": "Tested with the Valve Index\n\n1. Start SteamVR with one controller disconnected(My left one broke, RMA will take a couple months)\n\n2. Connect a tracker pinned to the hand where the controller is not connected\n\n3. Start VRChat\n\n5. Game menu is stuck to your controller hand, being unusable.\n\n4. Enable one handed movement within the radial menu\n\n6. One handed movement is enabled on the thumb stick of the MISSING controller and closing the menu disables one handed movent entirely!\n\nI made this not so short video explaining it: https://youtu.be/NsT-196g_44",
